        "fields": {
          "notes": "Peer-reviewed CDLB research Work published 2006-01-02; the publisher PDF reports version 2005-12-03. It argues from metrological contexts toward a source-reported 1N16 = 1/100 barig result. Current CDLI history supersedes the article-era N16 reading in P006303 with N24, while other cited cases remain separate evidence."
        },
